{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Backtest crypto strategies on 399 Coinbase coins without survivorship bias. DIY backtests usually use today's coin list, so dead coins vanish and returns are overstated; this rebuilds the universe from each past day's top coins. Breakout, momentum, dip-buy or MA-trend rules on daily data with fees, slippage, H1/H2 split and a luck flag. No data fetching or backtest code on your side. Price: $0.05 USDC per call (x402, Base mainnet). Free pre-check: validate_backtest. Free sample: backtest_sample.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"Breakout":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"params":{"$ref":"#/$defs/BreakoutParams","default":{"atr_mult":2.0,"gate":"btc_ma50","lookback":20,"max_position_pct":0.5,"max_positions":3,"max_stop_pct":0.4,"min_stop_pct":0.06,"risk_per_trade":0.05}},"type":{"const":"breakout","title":"Type","type":"string"}},"required":["type"],"title":"Breakout","type":"object"},"BreakoutParams":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"atr_mult":{"default":2.0,"description":"Trailing stop = highest close - k*ATR14","maximum":6,"minimum":0.5,"title":"Atr Mult","type":"number"},"gate":{"default":"btc_ma50","description":"Only open trades when BTC > 50-day SMA (btc_ma50) or >=50% of universe above 20d SMA (breadth50)","enum":["none","btc_ma50","breadth50"],"title":"Gate","type":"string"},"lookback":{"default":20,"description":"Buy when close > highest high of prior N days","maximum":60,"minimum":5,"title":"Lookback","type":"integer"},"max_position_pct":{"default":0.5,"exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":1.0,"title":"Max Position Pct","type":"number"},"max_positions":{"default":3,"maximum":10,"minimum":1,"title":"Max Positions","type":"integer"},"max_stop_pct":{"default":0.4,"exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":0.9,"title":"Max Stop Pct","type":"number"},"min_stop_pct":{"default":0.06,"exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":0.5,"title":"Min Stop Pct","type":"nu